Chief: Enough with the wise-cracks Harlow, I can't explain it over the phone but we need the services of the Federal Monkey Patrol. Meet me downtown and I'll have the lab boys run the details by you.<hangs up phone>

Harlow: The big boys need old Harlow, eh? This could change everything. Who knows? Maybe they'll let me fly again. Perhaps I'll even give up the booze....

Harlow: Though, that can wait till after breakfast. Time to go!
